  m_text: "The plague came suddenly. The Holy See suspects it is a curse wrought
    by heretics; you must investigate thoroughly and leave no heretic unexamined.
    As the town\u2019s ruler, the Duke of Windsor has allowed matters to deteriorate
    to this point\u2014keep a close watch on his household. I\u2019ve heard the eldest
    son is a missionary; speak with him at length and see what you can learn.\r"
